[24.030991, "o", "e2e cache proof 20261107T170601Z subject=Stripe model=gemini-3.1-flash-lite gateway=http://127.0.0.1:8080 commit=20107f1\r\nPASS  1 first request      MISS_COLD              9 claims, 1 call(s)\r\nPASS  2 same evidence      HIT                    9 claims, 1 call(s)\r\nPASS  3 newer article      REFUSE_NEWER_SOURCE    10 claims, 1 call(s)\r\n\r\naudit oracle (scripts/verify_audit.py, 3 audit lines from this run only):\r\nlookups 3  hits 1  hit rate 33.3%\r\nstale serves 0  (stale answers prevented: 1)\r\nsaved (LLM only): 5496 tokens  $0.0016\r\ndecisions {'MISS_COLD': 1, 'HIT': 1, 'REFUSE_NEWER_SOURCE': 1}\r\nbenchmark (expected until measured against audit log): 5-min TTL (high false miss) vs 24h TTL (high stale serve) vs ChronoBrief (0% stale serve)\r\npitch: \"Generate once, reuse when the evidence is unchanged, regenerate when the retrieved facts move.\"\r\n"]
